# Vue/TypeScript编码规范

##1.命名约定

- **组件文件**:PascalCase(`UserProfile.vue`、`AdminTable.vue`)
- **非组件文件**:kebab-case(`http.ts`、`user-store.ts`)
- **变量/函数**:camelCase(`userList`、`fetchUserData`)
- **常量**:UPPER_SNAKE_CASE(`MAX_PAGE_SIZE`、`API_BASE_URL`)
- **类型/接口**:PascalCase加前缀(`UserVO`、`LoginReq`、`ApiResponse<T>`)
- **Pinia store**:camelCase加`use`前缀+`Store`后缀(`useUserStore`、`useAppStore`)

##2.Composition API强制规范

所有组件必须使用`<script setup lang="ts">`，禁止Options API。

```vue
<!--正确-->
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,computed} from 'vue'

const count = ref(0)
const double = computed(()=>count.value*2)
</script>

<!--错误-Options API禁止-->
<script lang="ts">
export default{
data(){return{count:0}},
computed:{double(){return this.count*2}}
}
</script>
```

##3.TypeScript使用规范

-所有函数参数和返回值必须显式声明类型
-对象形状优先用`interface`而非`type`(Vue生态惯例)
-使用泛型`defineProps<T>()`和`defineEmits<T>()`而非运行时声明

```vue
<!--正确-->
<script setup lang="ts">
interface UserVO{
id:number
username:string
email:string
}

const props = defineProps<{
user:UserVO
showDetail?:boolean
}>()

const emit = defineEmits<{
(e:'update',id:number):void
}>()
</script>

<!--错误-运行时声明-->
<script setup lang="ts">
const props = defineProps({
user:{type:Object,required:true},
showDetail:{type:Boolean,default:false}
})
</script>
```

##4.模板风格

```vue
<!--正确-->
<template>
<div class="user-card">
<el-card>
<template #header>
<span>{{user.name}}</span>
</template>
<p>{{user.bio}}</p>
</el-card>
</div>
</template>

<!--错误-内联样式和混乱结构-->
<template>
<div style="margin:10px;padding:5px">
<el-card><span slot="header">{{user.name}}</span><p>{{user.bio}}</p></el-card>
</div>
</template>
```

##5.导入顺序

按以下分组顺序导入，组间空行分隔：

```typescript
//1.Vue核心
import {ref,computed,onMounted} from 'vue'
import {useRouter} from 'vue-router'

//2.第三方库
import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus'
import axios from 'axios'

//3.本地组件
import UserCard from './components/UserCard.vue'

//4.本地composables/utils
import {useAuth} from '@/composables/useAuth'
import {formatDate} from '@/utils/format'
```

##6.Less/Style规则

```vue
<!--正确-scoped样式-->
<style scoped lang="less">
.user-card{
margin-bottom:16px;

.card-header{
font-size:16px;
font-weight:bold;
}
}
</style>

<!--错误-未使用scoped-->
<style lang="less">
.user-card{margin-bottom:16px;}
</style>
```